1
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:04,903
India has more than six crore small businesses,

2
00:00:04,943 --> 00:00:07,399
yet only seven in a hundred leads go live,

3
00:00:07,439 --> 00:00:09,954
after seventeen days and three chase calls.

4
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:12,808
Udyam Digital, by Accel Business,

5
00:00:12,848 --> 00:00:17,373
does it in one sitting. A new owner just taps Get started.

6
00:00:17,683 --> 00:00:21,640
Step one, your needs. The owner describes the business in

7
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:24,725
their own words: a dental clinic in Kolkata,

8
00:00:24,765 --> 00:00:25,918
with eight staff.

9
00:00:26,216 --> 00:00:29,299
Gemini reads the profile. Our pricing engine,

10
00:00:29,339 --> 00:00:32,768
not the AI, picks only the products this clinic is

11
00:00:32,808 --> 00:00:33,670
eligible for.

12
00:00:33,983 --> 00:00:37,459
Step two, your plan. One clear monthly price,

13
00:00:37,499 --> 00:00:40,897
with add-ons the owner can switch on or off.

14
00:00:41,216 --> 00:00:44,258
Saving the plan asks for a mobile number and a one-time

15
00:00:44,298 --> 00:00:46,835
code. This is the only sign-in in the journey.

16
00:00:47,149 --> 00:00:50,120
Step three, verification. After giving consent,

17
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,170
the owner chooses the fast path:

18
00:00:52,210 --> 00:00:52,875
DigiLocker.

19
00:00:53,182 --> 00:00:56,095
The code goes to the mobile registered with UIDAI,

20
00:00:56,135 --> 00:00:59,461
and the e-Aadhaar, PAN, GST and Udyam certificates arrive

21
00:00:59,501 --> 00:01:01,469
signed by the issuing departments.

22
00:01:01,782 --> 00:01:03,688
We check every signature on our server,

23
00:01:03,728 --> 00:01:06,034
and the business is verified in about a minute.

24
00:01:06,349 --> 00:01:09,733
Step four, installation. The owner e-signs the contract

25
00:01:09,773 --> 00:01:12,098
with a one-time code, and pays by UPI.

26
00:01:12,416 --> 00:01:13,893
Then picks an installation slot,

27
00:01:13,933 --> 00:01:15,884
and follows every step on a dated tracker,

28
00:01:15,924 --> 00:01:16,975
with no calls to chase.

29
00:01:17,283 --> 00:01:20,785
No DigiLocker? The owner starts from the GST registration

30
00:01:20,825 --> 00:01:21,717
number instead.

31
00:01:22,016 --> 00:01:23,780
To prove the business is theirs,

32
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:27,050
they verify the business PAN, and a one-rupee test deposit

33
00:01:27,090 --> 00:01:29,079
must come back in the business name.

34
00:01:29,383 --> 00:01:32,247
Document photos are then read on our server,

35
00:01:32,287 --> 00:01:34,228
by OCR and a second AI reader,

36
00:01:34,268 --> 00:01:36,406
and matched against the registry.

37
00:01:36,716 --> 00:01:39,737
Here the certificate's GSTIN fails its checksum,

38
00:01:39,777 --> 00:01:42,351
so the case drops to a lower trust level,

39
00:01:42,391 --> 00:01:44,901
and the owner sends it to a KYC officer.

40
00:01:45,216 --> 00:01:48,501
Fraud is stopped by design. A GSTIN already verified for

41
00:01:48,541 --> 00:01:51,707
another owner is a hard stop that no one can override.

42
00:01:52,016 --> 00:01:54,579
The KYC officer sees only what failed,

43
00:01:54,619 --> 00:01:57,936
with the registry and each document side by side.

44
00:01:58,249 --> 00:02:01,743
To override, Priya must open every document and give a

45
00:02:01,783 --> 00:02:03,640
reason for each failed check.

46
00:02:03,949 --> 00:02:07,659
A second officer, Rahul, sees the override and its reason,

47
00:02:07,699 --> 00:02:11,279
and confirms it. Every step is written to the audit log.

48
00:02:11,582 --> 00:02:14,681
Leads the journey could not close go to a local partner,

49
00:02:14,721 --> 00:02:16,979
ranked by how likely they are to convert,

50
00:02:17,019 --> 00:02:17,931
with the reasons.

51
00:02:18,249 --> 00:02:20,892
In the field, the technician installs the kit,

52
00:02:20,932 --> 00:02:23,343
runs a speed test, and checks in with GPS,

53
00:02:23,383 --> 00:02:25,734
confirming the address and the signboard.

54
00:02:26,049 --> 00:02:29,410
Only the owner's sign-off code switches the line on.

55
00:02:29,716 --> 00:02:31,226
Operations sees the live funnel,

56
00:02:31,266 --> 00:02:33,018
and every order that needs attention,

57
00:02:33,058 --> 00:02:34,956
against the baseline from the case data.

58
00:02:35,249 --> 00:02:37,522
On WhatsApp, in ten Indian languages,

59
00:02:37,562 --> 00:02:40,274
an owner chats in Hindi, taps a few buttons,

60
00:02:40,314 --> 00:02:41,837
and gets a priced bundle.

61
00:02:44,016 --> 00:02:47,329
One tap starts the order, and later a single tap shows its

62
00:02:47,369 --> 00:02:49,122
live status, right in the chat.

63
00:02:52,433 --> 00:02:54,994
We are Team Ticchi Gang from NSUT Delhi.

64
00:02:55,034 --> 00:02:55,644
Thank you.
